  "question": {
    "text": "The wave number of first line of Balmer series of hydrogen is 1520 <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> . The wave number of first Balmer line of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ion in <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math> <mtext>x</mtext> </math>. Find the value of <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mtext>x</mtext> <mrow> <mtext>100</mtext></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "136.8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "For a given line of hydrogen-like species, frequency, <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />So <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1520</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>13680</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
